
--- Moves the test's virtual clock forward by `d` at once, without waiting (ADR 0116 rule 19,
--- `spec/26 §8`). Usable only in examples and in handlers that only examples install
--- (`spec/14 §4`).
pub elapse(d: Int of Millisecond) -> Unit
  requires d >= 0
=
  unit

--- Why `test_request` refuses a request: the host would answer it `400` (ADR 0123 rule 21,
--- `spec/31 §4`).
pub kind TestRequestError = | Refused

--- A request as the host would read it from a peer (ADR 0123 rule 21, `spec/31 §4`): its target
--- read by the host's own rules, the only header `host: test`, the peer `192.0.2.1` and the
--- listener `test`. Fails with `Refused` where the host would answer `400`. Usable only in
--- examples and in handlers that only examples install (`spec/14 §4`).
pub test_request(method: Method, target: Text, body: Text) -> Request
  fails TestRequestError
=
  fail Refused

--- An exchange of `request` with a fresh reply right, distinct from every other reply right of
--- the run (ADR 0123 rule 21, `spec/31 §1`). Usable only in examples and in handlers that only
--- examples install (`spec/14 §4`).
pub test_exchange(request: Request) -> Exchange = test_exchange(request)
